

>> Cat := Walax cusub.

Cat marka: ['cusub'] samee: {
	iska-leh sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat marka: ['nieuw'] samee: {
	iska-leh sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat marka: ['makeSound'] samee: { <- iska-leh sound.
}.

Cat marka: ['greet'] samee: { <- naf makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat cusub.
Soo-saar qor: cat greet.
